## Security Features (Day 1)
- ✅ Password hashing with bcryptjs
- ✅ JWT access tokens (1h expiry)
- ✅ Refresh tokens (7d expiry)
- ✅ HttpOnly cookies for refresh tokens
- ✅ Role-based field in User model
- ✅ Email duplicate validation
- ✅ Password validation (min 6 chars)

## Frontend Setup
The frontend uses React with Axios for API calls. Set baseURL:
```javascript
axios.defaults.baseURL = '/api/v1';
```

## Database Setup
Ensure MongoDB is running and create connection in config/db.js

